{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a4bd36cfd8562ebf3e455291ccc6526e77253cf35d0f5047a5effb2ebdcc764b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f4e398879f8542d3193fbcbe4aea42812b8725103f8ec40cabeb3cf12edf6b",
      "text": "啊，喂喂监督？\n和享介的碰头，顺利按时赶上了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317c844852824a822a94df493d2e86eadd2565f31589e7d2a828799a524a0b3f",
      "text": "前几天一起挑选的巧克力，\n也好好地送出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5760850ebb5a8b8a894580bb96b66f60fc0626f92591ad5b1c1dc0e8c337880",
      "text": "帮我一起挑，真的太感谢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:523775b87cdbd5d6b4112b041a5792b464d4d38884368b93bc63f19f5da4cae1",
      "text": "太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c78b8d5a95bfa1c3b53c059b4e0821602844dadbdce23d6216d07364d3d1a154",
      "text": "对方反应怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f6b9f3675ac0747b67591b604ee015fda632ddbb37563d192520612b6b6e329",
      "text": "嗯，享介也很高兴！不过呢，我本以为是惊喜，\n他却好像没那么惊讶，结果一问……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74d7435e87e5eeb36836a01c8486a34b880084fe0d2f8edb0477cab5b165cb38",
      "text": "他很高兴哦。不过，明明是个惊喜，\n他却好像没那么惊讶，结果一问……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac3e9bb5500e9247e7db82a3f5b3afc1b75f8d15f39a0144751b486d0b08b4f",
      "text": "原来享介也给我\n准备了巧克力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e67cd85207134e7479da59c46a9ccc22cc5fc241400c703d8fe26daba26f8fc",
      "text": "本来是想吓他一跳的，\n反倒是我们这边吃了一惊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3261dcfa50dd3d5d5679dcb2b0662b030651fad5134b75888f9422c557e76e9e",
      "text": "听说是因为前阵子我聊到了宣传活动的事，\n他就特意跑去那家百货商场买了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bbb6ce8265e39892715e58752696e2dfc42d1c83052c1213741b8de5cc04f97",
      "text": "不过，多亏了监督陪我一起挑，\n买的巧克力种类完全没有撞车。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e1fc4f2c73f63ce8bf90e843d8e5e1b6c0d30470577120581b305d6d41f015c",
      "text": "所以现在，我们两个人正在一起品尝对比呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_403_2_4_012_03_09_b:2_4_012_03_09_b:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c41d9e3de498c145815363a00eb147b07deab1aa1e2ff2c3281dafff170287",
      "text": "两种都超级好吃，下次也给监督带一份\n当慰问品哦！那就回聊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
